tellung der monatlichen Umsatzsteuervoranmeldungen und der Umsatzsteuerjahreserklärung ist nicht Gegenstand des Auftrages."},{"field_id":"BT-36-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":23.0},{"field_id":"BT-57-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Vertrag soll für den Zeitraum vom 03.02.2025 bis zum 31.12.2026 mit der Option zweimal jeweils um ein Jahr zu verlängern. Die Nutzung dieser Option muss seitens der Bergischen Universität Wuppertal schriftlich gegenüber dem Auftragnehmer erklärt werden."},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":2},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"education","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"body-pl-ra","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"LocalLegalBasisWithID","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-LocalLegalBasisWithID#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"typ